{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1344543-total-sensory-deprivation-and-mage-sight","id":1344543,"title":"Total Sensory Deprivation and Mage Sight","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-29T18:09:49-07:00","id":1344543,"title":"Total Sensory Deprivation and Mage Sight","content":"I had an idea for an interesting experiment for a cabal of mages to undertake. They use Life magic to take away all their senses including things like proprioception and balance and such, cutting off all information from the outside world, and use Life and Mind to remove them from their minds/brains a bit like they never had them in the first place. Once in this state of total lack of senses, they try activating Mage Sight despite there being no senses for it to be experienced through. The goal is to eventually develop their Mage Sight into a pure independent magical sense that isn't filtered through a mundane sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11888,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","user":"Custos Tenebrarum","date":". 10-29-2019, 09:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11888-custos-tenebrarum","name":"Custos Tenebrarum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-29T19:34:36-07:00","id":1344554,"title":"","content":"Theoretically doable, but I\u2019m dubious it would be beneficial. The Supernal still will likely end up interpreted the same way by their mind. You\u2019re essentially talking about like...if you could do math without using your brain or any external tools.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-30T00:10:04-07:00","id":1344593,"title":"","content":"I think it would be a good training to develop the mage sight merits on signs of sorcery","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T18:01:02-08:00","id":1345678,"title":"","content":"It's an interesting experiment, have an arcane beat. But I think the end goal is, to put it plainly, nonsensical. Mage Sight is about dicerning Supernal Truth from what you perceive. If you don't perceive anything, there's no Supernal Truth... I guess aside from your own Mind. Supernal Truth and the ways conscious beings perceive it can't be decoupled.<br /> <br /> If you want to use your mage sight through walls, on invisible beings, or in any way that goes beyond your normal senses... that's what Unveriling spells, and others also related to perception like Zoom In or Heightened Senses, are for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12673-ew-matias","name":"EW-Matias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}